    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/f14b49a0389821f2fea86ffd4329f541.avif?t=1754614830\" data-has-big width=800 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Job System:</strong>   <br>WonderKing begins with basic classes that can advance into multiple specialized paths as the character levels up. Each job has its own unique skills and combat style, allowing players to enjoy diverse gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest-Based Progression:</strong>   <br>Players develop their characters by completing a wide range of quests, which are deeply tied to the game\u2019s storyline and lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP and PvE Content:</strong>   <br>In addition to monster hunting, the game offers a variety of combat content such as player-versus-player battles (PvP), dungeon exploration, and boss raids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Costumes and Customization:</strong>   <br>Players can personalize their characters with various equipment, outfits, pets, and more, allowing for creative expression and individuality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Story Background</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story revolves around a journey to find the &quot;WonderKing,&quot; a legendary hero destined to save the world from an evil force threatening peace. Players take on the role of a protagonist with the potential to become the WonderKing, embarking on an adventure alongside various allies.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825780/extras/f14b49a0389821f2fea86ffd4329f541.avif?t=1754614830\" data-has-big width=800 height=332 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Job System:</strong>   <br>WonderKing begins with basic classes that can advance into multiple specialized paths as the character levels up. Each job has its own unique skills and combat style, allowing players to enjoy diverse gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest-Based Progression:</strong>   <br>Players develop their characters by completing a wide range of quests, which are deeply tied to the game\u2019s storyline and lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvP and PvE Content:</strong>   <br>In addition to monster hunting, the game offers a variety of combat content such as player-versus-player battles (PvP), dungeon exploration, and boss raids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Costumes and Customization:</strong>   <br>Players can personalize their characters with various equipment, outfits, pets, and more, allowing for creative expression and individuality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Story Background</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story revolves around a journey to find the &quot;WonderKing,&quot; a legendary hero destined to save the world from an evil force threatening peace. Players take on the role of a protagonist with the potential to become the WonderKing, embarking on an adventure alongside various allies.</p>",
